/T (After arriving in Jibhi, we will visit the beautiful Jibhi waterfall and soak in the soothing surroundings of the place. Visit another major attraction called Mini Thailand in Jibhi \(if time permits\). Check-in to our cozy homestay/hotel in Jibhi, freshen-up and have some leisure. Post lunch, we will head out for a forest walk near to our property and rejuvenate in the nature's lap. In the evening, enjoy a warm bonfire with good music. Savour home-style cooked dinner and overnight stay in a hotel/homestay in Jibhi/Banjar.)
